# Feature-based Clean Architecture (mandatory)

Nexo clone. Every feature is fully self-contained. Shared code lives only in `lib/core/`.
Layers: Presentation (UI + Bloc/Cubit) → Domain ← Data.
Domain never depends on other layers, Flutter, or UI/network packages.
Keep the architecture scalable. No god classes.

```
lib/
├── core/error/  network/  utils/  di/
├── features/<feature_name>/
│   ├── data/datasources/  models/  repositories/
│   ├── domain/entities/  repositories/  usecases/
│   └── presentation/bloc/  pages/  widgets/
└── main.dart
```

New code goes in this tree. Do not add screens, stores, or models at `lib/screens/` or `lib/state/`.
